 --> tests/ui/scxml061-ecmascript-data-id.scxml:6:15
  |
6 |     <data id="_total" expr="0"/>
  |               ^^^^^^ reserved for system variables
  |
  = note: SCXML reserves names that begin with `_` for system variables such as `_event`, `_sessionid`, `_name`, and `_ioprocessors`, and a conformant document declares no data with such an id
  = help: rename the data without the leading `_`, and update every reference to it
